From 4764a5f52bd67267a1b3c59c7985fb173d265e74 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Philippe Gerum <rpm@xenomai.org>
Date: Mon, 21 Nov 2022 13:42:03 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 0829/1010] evl: rename thread status bits

Rename all state and information bits for EVL threads to prevent
conflict with mainline symbols. Since these definitions are visible
from user-space, bump the ABI revision in the same move.

Signed-off-by: Philippe Gerum <rpm@xenomai.org>
---
